how to calculate_sum with val_a, val_b so
    var result is val_a plus val_b
    please give result
thats how

say "--- Function Call ---"
var total is calculate_sum(15, 25)
say "Sum of 15 and 25 is " plus total.

say "--- End of Demo ---
